<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">當山みれい</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">把最后见面的那天你给我的信</text><text for="L2">塞进提包的里面</text><text for="L3">旧手机里两人的照片</text><text for="L4">熟悉的风景逐渐流逝</text><text for="L5">追逐着不确定的梦</text><text for="L6">舍弃一切</text><text for="L7">无论如何请原谅</text><text for="L8">傻瓜一样的我</text><text for="L9">再见了，我最喜欢的人</text><text for="L10">直到终有一天迎来重逢之日</text><text for="L11">我绝对不会哭的</text><text for="L12">真正永远喜欢的人</text><text for="L13">不要回头啊，仍然goodbye my love</text><text for="L14">无论是你经常买给我的</text><text for="L15">甜的腻人的奶茶</text><text for="L16">还是每天使用的车站月台</text><text for="L17">都已经无法触碰</text><text for="L18">这样就足够了</text><text for="L19">美丽的回忆</text><text for="L20">结束了，都结束了</text><text for="L21">即使相隔万里</text><text for="L22">我也会祝你幸福</text><text for="L23">相爱真正的意义</text><text for="L24">现在我已经知道了哦</text><text for="L25">谢谢你，最喜欢的人</text><text for="L26">见面的时候</text><text for="L27">一直给我笑容</text><text for="L28">绝无仅有的爱人</text><text for="L29">不会忘记你的 仍然 goodbye my love</text><text for="L30">真的，如果和你在一起的话</text><text for="L31">就不会有害怕的东西了</text><text for="L32">再次回到那个时候，还太早了些</text><text for="L33">忘却时间，倾诉心声</text><text for="L34">在得到两人的闪闪发光的未来之前</text><text for="L35">在那天之前，请再给我一点时间</text><text for="L36">再见了，最喜欢的人</text><text for="L37">直到某日重逢的那天</text><text for="L38">我一定不会哭的</text><text for="L39">真心一直喜欢的人</text><text for="L40">不要回头啊，仍然goodbye my love</text><text for="L41">谢谢你，最喜欢的人</text><text for="L42">每次见面的时候</text><text for="L43">都带给我笑容</text><text for="L44">绝无仅有的爱人</text><text for="L45">我不会忘记你，仍然goodbye my love</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:03.370" end="0:08.850" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:03.370" end="0:03.940">最</span><span begin="0:03.940" end="0:04.110">後</span><span begin="0:04.110" end="0:04.430">に</span><span begin="0:04.430" end="0:04.730">会</span><span begin="0:04.730" end="0:04.820">っ</span><span begin="0:04.820" end="0:04.930">た</span><span begin="0:04.930" end="0:07.000">日</span><span begin="0:07.000" end="0:07.280">く</span><span begin="0:07.280" end="0:07.490">れ</span><span begin="0:07.490" end="0:07.700">た</span><span begin="0:07.700" end="0:07.920">手</span><span begin="0:07.920" end="0:08.370">紙</span><span begin="0:08.370" end="0:08.850">は</span></p><p begin="0:10.230" end="0:14.440" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:10.230" end="0:10.410">か</span><span begin="0:10.410" end="0:10.690">ば</span><span begin="0:10.690" end="0:10.910">ん</span><span begin="0:10.910" end="0:11.180">の</span><span begin="0:11.180" end="0:11.750">奥</span><span begin="0:11.750" end="0:12.730">に</span><span begin="0:12.730" end="0:12.930">押</span><span begin="0:12.930" end="0:13.170">し</span><span begin="0:13.170" end="0:13.440">込</span><span begin="0:13.440" end="0:14.270">ん</span><span begin="0:14.270" end="0:14.440">だ</span></p><p begin="0:16.930" end="0:23.220" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.930" end="0:17.410">2</span><span begin="0:17.410" end="0:17.670">人</span><span begin="0:17.670" end="0:17.800">の</span><span begin="0:17.800" end="0:18.010">写</span><span begin="0:18.010" end="0:18.540">真</span><span begin="0:18.540" end="0:20.280">は</span><span begin="0:20.280" end="0:20.850">古</span><span begin="0:20.850" end="0:21.010">い</span><span begin="0:21.010" end="0:21.410">携</span><span begin="0:21.410" end="0:21.870">帯</span><span begin="0:21.870" end="0:22.100">の</span><span begin="0:22.100" end="0:23.220">中</span></p><p begin="0:23.7